<speak>
  <s>Welcome to the Eureka Cycling committee portal walkthrough.</s>
  <s>We start at the sign in screen.</s>
  <s>Log in with your committee or treasurer account to access the tools.</s>
  <s>On the home page, you can confirm your role and check the latest backend status message.</s>
  <s>Next is the ledger, where treasurers review monthly transactions, balances, and cash, bank, or card activity.</s>
  <s>Financial reports provide year to date and prior financial year snapshots, including income, expenditure, and balance sheet summaries.</s>
  <s>Reimbursements let you review recent requests and prepare new submissions with receipts and member payment details.</s>
  <s>Documents organizes shared files and folders, with quick access to previews and downloads.</s>
  <s>That covers the main areas.</s>
  <s>Thanks for watching.</s>
</speak>
